            <ArticleTitle>[Ischemic heart disease: 2005 update].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3-19</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article is a review of the main developments in acute coronary syndromes reported in publications and conference presentations in 2005. It covers the pathophysiology, secondary prevention, prognosis, and treatment of ST-segment elevation and non-ST-segment elevation acute coronary syndromes, and the latest clinical practice guidelines.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
